Amnesia is one of those "features" that makes the game less fun, I
think. How many of you have never #quit-ed a well-prepared character
because of an amnesia attack? I know I have. I bet I could have
ascended them, but it's just no fun grinding away the hours
identifying things the second time.

I second the dunce cap approach. The dunce cap is already troublesome
to use, as it autocurses, is soft, gives poor AC and drops your
intelligence. It already protects against brainlessness, why not just
make it protect against amnesia as well? Would make the game strictly
funnier, IMO, and hardly change balance. If balance doesn't matter all
that much, it would be a possibility to extend sustain ability's brain
protection features in the same way.

